<title>JAPAN: Daicel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daicel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 82.25		vs	   78.98</p>
<p> Operating	    4.02		vs	    2.85</p>
<p> Current		3.44		vs	    1.92</p>
<p> Net		    1.46		vs	    1.05</p>
<p> EPS		    3.90 yen	  vs	    2.80 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    374 million	  vs	 374 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daicel Chemical Industries Ltd is a manufacturer of acetic acid and acetic acid cellulose.</p>
